WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:05.730
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to do at&nbsp;
the Foundation: Dr. Bright! You are NOT a pirate!

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.850
Okay, first of all, who told Dr.&nbsp;
Bright about "Talk Like a Pirate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:13.170
Day?" He doesn't need more reasons to dress&nbsp;
up in a costume and bother everyone. Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.770
I guess that's one cat we can't&nbsp;
put back in the bag, so...new rule.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.190
Whether it's Talk Like a Pirate Day&nbsp;
or not, Dr. Bright is not allowed to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:24.990
keel-haul anyone or force them to "walk the&nbsp;
plank" (where did he even get a plank?).

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.730
Even if he's wearing an eyepatch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:31.110
and even if he says "argh, Matey!"&nbsp;
a lot. And by the way, Dr. Bright,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:36.270
Yo Ho Ho and a Bottle of Rum is not appropriate&nbsp;
for the workplace. Leave the bottle at home.

